{"id":"en_ceo-your-wife-runs-the-game","title":"CEO, Your Wife Runs the Game","titleEn":"CEO, Your Wife Runs the Game","description":"Kang Renran agrees to marry Lu Shian as a way to rescue her first love and her brother. For an entire year, Lu Shian pays her no attention, so she decides to pursue a divorce. Just then, his former love Shu Ran reappears and begins plotting against Kang Renran. Rather than being defeated, Kang Renran uses every scheme against her as a chance to advance, eventually establishing a successful luxury resale enterprise. In the end, Lu Shian develops genuine feelings for her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/ceo-your-wife-runs-the-game/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/ceo-your-wife-runs-the-game/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Second Chance","The Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdn0m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_ceo-your-wife-runs-the-game_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdn0m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ceo-your-wife-runs-the-game_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdn0m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ceo-your-wife-runs-the-game_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdn0m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ceo-your-wife-runs-the-game_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdn0m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable"